# PROPOSED brain-db scope for the FRIDAY seat (the laptop seat, both clients).
# NOT live: braindb.sh reads only scope/<seat>.scope. Friday's coordinator
# reviews this file and copies it to scope/friday.scope to adopt it (see
# INSTRUCTIONS-for-other-seats.md). Exercised on fixtures only by tests/run.sh.

seat friday
own_clients secuura datasec general
# Friday works for both clients, so no client is denied by tier. Kam or the
# coordinator should confirm that before adoption.

allow rules        CLAUDE.md
allow rules        0_Brain/CLAUDE.md
allow lesson       0_Brain/learnings/20*.md
allow rules_index  0_Brain/learnings/_rules_index.tsv
allow ledger       0_Brain/learnings/_ledger_friday.md
allow ledger       0_Brain/learnings/_ledger_friday_archive.md
allow daily        0_Brain/daily_friday/20*.md
allow skill        0_Brain/skills/*.md
allow identity     0_Brain/identity/*.md
allow people       0_Brain/people/*.md
allow architecture 1_Project_Definition/Architecture/*.md

deny_path (conflict_on_
deny_path .pre-

# another seat's own records (a folder name of any kind; the file name of a ledger or daily note)
deny_seat_word tuesday
deny_seat_word wednesday
deny_seat_word laptop_datasec
